         <div type="commentary" subtype="frontmatter" xml:space="preserve"><p>This digital edition covers the three bigger fragments that make POxy. XV 1790; the other fifteen fragments, from both 1790 and 2081, are given in the editions of Grenfell-Hunt, Barron and Davies.</p><p>As in the reference edition (Davies), all the restorations that are not considered in the apparatus were made by the first editors, Grenfell and Hunt.</p></div>
